# Kaslem's Stonetree // Kaslem's Strider. As the Stonetree enters Bot1 looks at the top six cards of its library and may put
# a land card from among them onto the battlefield tapped - not the Ornithopter (refused), Sunken Citadel, a Cave, whose
# color is chosen as it enters; the other five go to the bottom in a random order. On turn three "Craft with Cave {5}{G}"
# (CR 702.167a-b) may not exile the Island Bot1 played (refused) and does exile the Citadel; the Stonetree returns as
# Kaslem's Strider, a vanilla 5/5 green Golem artifact creature.

